FreshBench
Copyright 2026 the FreshBench authors

FreshBench's metric families (control-flow graph edit distance against the
source, type recovery against DWARF, recompilation byte match, Union of
perfect scores) follow DecBench by Noelo-Lab (https://github.com/Noelo-Lab/decbench).
No DecBench code is included. FreshBench v1 (tag v1) used DecBench and
rust-joern (Apache-2.0, https://github.com/Noelo-Lab/rust-joern) as
external dependencies.
